ve as "},{"code":"400","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with an "},{"code":"OAuth2ErrorResponse","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and §14.2 rule 5 requires dispatching on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"code":"error","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" field rather than the status: this throws an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AuthError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AuthError\/oauthError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" carries that field, so a caller driving its own loop can tell"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"authorization_pending","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"slow_down","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (keep going) from "},{"code":"access_denied","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"expired_token","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"invalid_grant","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (stop). The sixth, "},{"code":"401","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"invalid_client","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (contract"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"1.62), is dispatched the same way and is terminal: a failed client authentication is not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an expired session, so it is not retried and does not enter the §9 refresh guard."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"code":"5xx","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is a transport failure whatever its body (§14.2 rule 6, contract 1.64 amended): it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is first retried under §16 inside this call (a "},{"code":"429","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" never is), then throws the §2"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/NetworkError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and the loop keeps polling. A "},{"code":"429","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is rule 9’s wait"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whatever its body names; this call throws it as "},{"code":"rate_limit_exceeded","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when the body is an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OAuth error, and as the §2 "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/NetworkError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when it is not."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Client authentication (§14.1 rules 2 and 3)."}]},{"text":" Every poll sends ","type":"text"},{"code":"client_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A client","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"configured with ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamConfig\/oidcClientSecret","type":"reference"},{"text":" also sends it as ","type":"text"},{"code":"client_secret","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"form body — never as ","type":"text"},{"code":"Authorization: Basic","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", whatever the client is registered for — and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"client with a §6.1 certificate presents it on the connection; a public client sends","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"neither. This SDK verifies DPoP proofs but does not generate them (§21.9), so a client","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"registered for DPoP cannot be driven from here: its poll is refused ","type":"text"},{"code":"401 invalid_client","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and surfaces as above. A response whose ","type":"text"},{"code":"token_type","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"DPoP","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is surfaced as the server","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"said it (","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OidcTokenSet\/tokenType","type":"reference"},{"text":"), never assumed to be ","type":"text"},{"code":"Bearer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/deviceLogin(scope:tenantID:configuration:onAuthorization:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" is the loop most callers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"want; this exists for one that needs its own.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/devicepoll(devicecode:tenantid:configuration:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC10devicePoll0D4Code8tenantID13configurationAA12OidcTokenSetVAA9SensitiveVySSG_SSSgAA0J13ConfigurationVSgtYaKF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","title":"devicePoll(deviceCode:tenantID:configuration:)","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"devicePoll"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"deviceCode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sensitive"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tenantID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"configuration"},{"kind":"text","text":":